# `gridLayouts` JSON

The `gridLayouts` section defines all layouts built for the dashboard.

For more information about layouts for CRM Analytics dashboards, see [Generate Unique Dashboard Layouts for Different Devices](https://help.salesforce.com/apex/HTViewHelpDoc?id=bi_dashboard_layout_select_flex.htm). .

